#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-skysight-mono.rst:17
#: 67c0f7115fb8491f9f527c4956283345
msgid "Overview"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-skysight-mono.rst:19
#: 2c4de18f8d034a2a972da6d6e365a276
msgid "ArduPilot allows you to :ref:`configure a servo or relay output as the control signal for the camera shutter <common-camera-shutter-with-servo>` so that it can be used in :ref:`Camera Missions <common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner>`. Additional hardware is required to convert the shutter activation signal to the format expected by the particular camera."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-skysight-mono.rst:24
#: e3ba6696d16f42e3984fbc27f5b33c38
msgid "Farsight's `SkySight MONO <http://skysight.eu/?product=skysight-mono>`__ provides everything needed to connect a Pixhawk to a supported Sony MultiPort™ equipped camera in order to automate camera shutter triggering. The current list of compatible cameras is on the `product page <http://skysight.eu/?product=skysight-mono>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-skysight-mono.rst:29
#: ccb7e18f6ccf40ed8c84917789f16df4
msgid "The board supports four camera triggering modes, allowing you to trigger the shutter in single shot and burst modes, both with and without first setting the autofocus. The mode used is determined by the servo PWM output set in the :ref:`Camera Shutter Configuration <common-camera-shutter-with-servo>` in Mission Planner."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-skysight-mono.rst:34
#: a7af5a1eb506430d8a50e26bfc04e1bc
msgid "This article provides a brief overview of how to set up the board (images are reproduced courtesy of Farsight). More detailed instructions are provided in the `SkySight MONO User Manual <http://skysight.eu/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/MONO-User-Manual.pdf>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-skysight-mono.rst:39
#: 093c64dfeca74a9bbbc4d1f3289eaae7
msgid "Parts and hardware connections"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-skysight-mono.rst:41
#: 6559e54d466e40b7a1fe0f43fddc46bc
msgid "The SkySight MONO can be `purchased from FarSight <http://skysight.eu/?product=skysight-mono>`__, and comes with the cables you need to connect to Pixhawk and the camera."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-skysight-mono.rst:47
#: b596e20a4b0a4fb5a20a25d2c28c94db
msgid "SkySight Mono: Board and Cables"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-skysight-mono.rst:49
